      },
      "lineNbr": 28,
      "author": {
        "id": 1934715
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-11T16:23:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@aliceryhl@google.com, is there something similar that doesn\u0027t create any virtual mappings? Using vmalloc() in this scenario isn\u0027t ideal because of the reasons I mentioned above, and there\u0027s no requirement for the pages to be virtually contiguous either.",
      "parentUuid": "0cba5ed2_f9f65bb5",
      "revId": "627ecef83bfad9096784006ff893aa1c839da082",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
