      "writtenOn": "2026-09-17T16:32:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@andih@google.com could we do something like what\u0027s being done here: https://cs.android.com/android/kernel/superproject/+/common-android-mainline:common/rust/kernel/page.rs;l\u003d228\n\nWe can call `alloc_page()` and then \"kmap\" it (i.e. get the address) so that we don\u0027t have to use `vmalloc()`?",
      "parentUuid": "33d28771_e94781e8",
      "revId": "627ecef83bfad9096784006ff893aa1c839da082",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
