      "message": "Unfortunately given the current APIs in dma_buf that take references to slices (not raw pointers) to memcpy calls I don\u0027t think we can. The `Page` APIs in rust/kernel/page.rs \"suffer\" from the same issue you pointed out when I introduced the `FreePage` abstraction on top of get_free_page - namely, the underlying memory is to be considered uninitialized and therefore the raw pointers must not be turned into references.",
